ftp://gatekeeper.dec.com/pub/DEC/Linux-Alpha/Kernels/ldmilo-ruffian-981020
ftp://gatekeeper.dec.com/pub/DEC/Linux-Alpha/Kernels/milo-ruffian-981020
and copy them on a DOS-floppy.
