ruffian.img and ramdisk.img
on two floppies (see RedHat-Manual).

4)Start Setup: go back to ARCS BIOS:
 <Enter Setup>
 <Run a Progrogram>
  a:ldmilo.exe
.. normal redhat-alpha-installation

