nameserver. When I wasn't conected to the namesever I couldn't telnet, 
ftp or nfs-mount and when I was, i could only use hosts with known
names.
The deamons or clients seem to do a nslookup of the IP to see if that
host is allowed to connect or not. This lookup freezes or fails and
then the ftp, telnet or nfs-mount is doesn't work.

