> ncr53c810-0: dp0,d7-0,rst,req,ack,bsy,sel,atn,msg,c/d,i/o = 0x309,
> expecting 0x100
> ncr53c810-0: FATAL ERROR: CHECK SCSI BUS - CABLES, TERMINATOR, DEVICE
> POWER etc.!
